---
import SiteLayout from '../layouts/SiteLayout.astro';
---
<SiteLayout title="联系我们 - 江南枝" description="联系江南枝茶叶品牌，咨询产品订购、品牌合作或茶叶品鉴，我们期待您的来信。">
<section class="pt-32 pb-16 bg-secondary text-center">
<div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-6">
<h1 class="font-serif text-4xl lg:text-5xl font-bold text-foreground mb-6">联系江南枝</h1>
<p class="text-muted-foreground text-lg leading-relaxed">江南枝是源自江南原产地的茶叶品牌，秉持「守一枝茶香，归一味本真」的理念。如您对茶叶订购、品牌合作或品鉴体验有任何疑问，欢迎通过以下方式联系我们。</p>
</div>
</section>
<section class="py-20 lg:py-28 bg-background">
<div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-6 lg:px-8">
<div class="flex flex-col lg:flex-row items-center justify-center gap-12 lg:gap-20">
<div class="" data-reveal="" data-delay="0">
<div class="w-full max-w-lg mx-auto text-center">
